  "body": "Experience the perfect harmony of style, comfort, and location in this architecturally designed freehold family  home, set in one of Auckland’s most desirable coastal neighbourhoods. Enjoy morning walks along Tamaki Drive, relaxed afternoons on the beach, and evenings framed by Rangitoto’s skyline, all just moments from home.\r\n\r\nWhy You’ll Love It:\r\n\r\n• Contemporary Design Across Three Levels – Light-filled open living, a versatile ground-floor space, and seamless flow to an expansive deck for effortless indoor-outdoor living.\r\n\r\n• Wonderful Indoor - Outdoor Flow with Amazing Views – Enjoy sweeping outlooks towards Rangitoto Island from your living areas and outdoor spaces—an ever-changing coastal backdrop, perfect for friend and family gatherings for the upcoming summer!\r\n\r\n• Gourmet Kitchen with Scullery – A sleek, modern design with premium finishes and ample storage, perfect for entertaining.\r\n\r\n• Private Bedroom Retreats – Three upper-level bedrooms, including a luxurious master suite with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, plus a second lounge for quiet relaxation.\r\n\r\n• Elegant Bathrooms & Secure Parking – 3.5 stylish bathrooms and a double internal-access garage for convenience and peace of mind.\r\n\r\nLocation Highlights:\r\n\r\n• Steps to Tamaki Drive beaches, cafés, and coastal walkways\r\n\r\n• Close to boutique shops, parks, and transport links\r\n\r\n• Zoned for top schools: Selwyn College and Orakei Primary\r\n\r\nA lifestyle of sophistication and ease awaits. Contact us today to arrange your private viewing—homes of this calibre are rarely available.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
